# External clones
/external/*

/Exec/WORK/*
ic.txt
# plt*/chk* are AMReX OUTPUT DIRECTORIES, which are always plt<digits> /
# chk<digits>. Anchor on the digits: the bare globs also matched
# scoring/plt_guard.py, so that module was silently never tracked despite a
# commit message describing it, and it survived only on the rented pod --
# leaving seven scoring scripts unimportable on any fresh clone.
plt[0-9]*
chk[0-9]*
tmp_build_dir
.ccls-cache
ERF*.ex
AMReX_buildInfo.cpp
cmake-build*
cmake_build*
cmake*ser*
cmake*par*
.idea
*.ipynb
job_info

