/scoring_jan9*/
/*.npy

# CONUS404 frame sets and the invariant arrays they are built from (2026-08-04).
# Regenerable: pod/fetch_c404_invariant.py then conus404_to_bin.py, but the
# fetch is ~70 min of OPeNDAP, so treat what is on disk as primary data.
/pod_data_A_3km/
/pod_data_A_3km_tail/
/pod_data_A_run30h/
# 10 hourly 11-field (ice-bearing) CONUS404 frames, 12/27 22Z .. 12/28 07Z.
# ~666 MB of float32 binaries, regenerable with conus404_to_bin.py -- see the
# invocation recorded in UPSTREAM_ISSUES. Never commit frames.
/pod_data_hourly_ice/
/c404_invariant/
/_archive/
/.codegraph/

# Derived data from the ChannelIslands campaign: regenerable from the frames and
